 by using a centralized SDN controller, the network is controlled. After programming the network in tune with our application, packets are generated to test different applications that we developed on the SDN. This project demonstrates the different capabilities of SDN, by implementing 3 major network applications- SDN switch as a hub, SDN switch as a Firewall, and Selective Routing using SDN.","topics":[],"score":214074,"global_rank":253355},{"name":"kenwithee/daemon_example","owner":"kenwithee","html_url":"https://github.com/kenwithee/daemon_example","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"A simple linux daemon example","topics":[],"score":214073,"global_rank":253361},{"name":"JacopoMangiavacchi/SwiftPipelineMacClient","owner":"JacopoMangiavacchi","html_url":"https://github.com/JacopoMangiavacchi/SwiftPipelineMacClient","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"SwiftPipeline macOS test client app","topics":[],"score":214073,"global_rank":253365},{"name":"johnelliott/auto-darkmode.vim","owner":"johnelliott","html_url":"https://github.com/johnelliott/auto-darkmode.vim","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Vim script","description":null,"topics":[],"score":214073,"global_rank":253366},{"name":"vivlim/character-select","owner":"vivlim","html_url":"https://github.com/vivlim/character-select","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"ShaderLab","description":null,"topics":[],"score":214073,"global_rank":253367},{"name":"joseph-exists/exidet","owner":"joseph-exists","html_url":"https://github.com/joseph-exists/exidet","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":214070,"global_rank":253374},{"name":"Zachary-Ip/Zachary-Ip","owner":"Zachary-Ip","html_url":"https://github.com/Zachary-Ip/Zachary-Ip","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Zach's personal github repository","topics